    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d142">

                <pb facs="0336" n="222" sameAs="frus:frus1924v01/pg222"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">150.01/799</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Rumanian Chargé</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Nano</hi>)</head>
                <p>The Secretary of State presents his compliments to the Chargé d’Affaires ad
                    interim of Rumania and has the honor to acknowledge the receipt of his <hi
                        rendition="#italic">note verbale</hi> (535/1) of the 2d instant, in which
                    under instructions of his Government he protests against certain immigration
                    legislation now pending in the Congress of the United States.</p>
                <p>In reply the Secretary of State begs to say that copies of the note of the Chargé
                    d’Affaires have been referred to the appropriate authorities.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1924-02-19"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">February 19, 1924</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
